│ Intended Behavior:                                                 │
│ The :type: and :rtype: directives should resolve to the correct    │
│ class or function in the current module and its parent modules,    │
│ not all submodules.                                                │
│                                                                    │
│ Bug Location 2:                                                    │
│ File: sphinx/ext/autodoc.py                                        │
│ Class/Method: None (directly related to directive processing)      │
